ages.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scppsl.jpg"}, {"id": 1199830, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scppsm.jpg"}, {"id": 1199831, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scppsn.jpg"}, {"id": 1199832, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scppso.jpg"}, {"id": 1199833, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scppsp.jpg"}], "slug": "emergency-call-the-attack-squad", "storyline": "As a member of the attack squad, you carry out a variety of exciting missions ranging from apartment and car fires to rescuing people as well as many others. Do you have what it takes to complete the challenges ahead?\n\nWhen you arrive on the scene, you start where the attack squad begins to operate. The extinguishing water connection is already in place, the turntable ladder is ready for use and all the materials you need for an indoor or outdoor attack are at your disposal right from the start. You are therefore well equipped to successfully complete any operation.\n\nAfter you arrive you first have to survey the scene to get an overview of the situation. Then you can start to work on the primary and secondary objec\u00adtives.\n\nDepending on the situation, you will have to decide for yourself in which order you want to complete the tasks. However, be prepared for incidents that may occur during the operation, such as explo\u00adsions of gas cylinders, if they are not found and extinguished in time. During the missions, remember that your own safety and that of the people involved is always paramount!\n\nDo you have what it takes to master the exciting everyday work of the attack squad?", "summary": "Take on the role of the attack squad, explore the scene and work through the challenges in a reasonable way.\n\nThe unclear damage situation at the beginning of every scene, whether it is fires, rescue of people or technical assistance requires your attention. Keep in mind that the choice of the right tools is just as important as a reasonable tactical order you have to decide on, when exploring and working through the operations.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 34, "name": "Educational"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/emergency-call-the-attack-squad", "videos": [{"id": 103472, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "97KVKYA1Bso", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=97KVKYA1Bso", "title": "Notruf 112 - Der Angriffstrupp | Release Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/97KVKYA1Bso/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 170534, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Z0weHrRxX0Y", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z0weHrRxX0Y", "title": "Emergency Call 112 - The Attack Squad | Release Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Z0weHrRxX0Y/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}